## 3. INTEGRATION TEST (Postman + Newman)

### 3.1 Collection Structure

```
eprocure-{service}.postman_collection.json
├── Auth Setup          ← Pre-request: login, lấy cookie
├── Happy Path
│   ├── [POST] Tạo PR                      → 201 + assert prNumber
│   ├── [GET]  Xem PR vừa tạo              → 200 + assert fields
│   ├── [POST] Submit PR                   → 200 + status = PENDING_APPROVAL
│   ├── [GET]  Approval Inbox (manager)    → 200 + task tồn tại
│   ├── [POST] Approve task               → 200 + PR approved
│   └── [GET]  PR status = APPROVED       → 200
├── Error Cases
│   ├── [POST] Tạo PR không có line items  → 400 + code=PR_020
│   ├── [POST] Submit PR ngân sách thiếu   → 422 + code=PR_002
│   ├── [POST] Approve không có quyền      → 403 + code=IAM_004
│   └── [POST] Submit PR đã submit         → 409 + code=PR_010
├── Idempotency
│   ├── [POST] Tạo PR lần 1               → 201
│   └── [POST] Tạo PR cùng key lần 2      → 200 + same prNumber
└── Cleanup             ← Cancel các PR test vừa tạo
```

### 3.2 Postman Test Script Template

```javascript
// ✅ Pre-request: Login và lấy cookie
pm.sendRequest({
    url: pm.environment.get('base_url') + '/auth/login',
    method: 'POST',
    header: {
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
        'Idempotency-Key': pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$randomUUID}}')
    },
    body: {
        mode: 'raw',
        raw: JSON.stringify({
            username: pm.environment.get('test_username'),
            password: pm.environment.get('test_password')
        })
    }
}, function (err, response) {
    const cookie = response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');
    pm.environment.set('session_cookie', cookie);
});

// ✅ Test script
pm.test("Status code là 201", () => {
    pm.response.to.have.status(201);
});

pm.test("Response có đúng structure", () => {
    const body = pm.response.json();
    pm.expect(body.success).to.be.true;
    pm.expect(body.code).to.equal('PR_CREATED');
    pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('prNumber');
    pm.expect(body.data.prNumber).to.match(/^PR-\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{5}$/);
    pm.expect(body.data.status).to.equal('DRAFT');
    pm.expect(body.timestamp).to.not.be.null;
    pm.expect(body.requestId).to.not.be.null;
});

pm.test("prNumber lưu vào env cho test tiếp theo", () => {
    const body = pm.response.json();
    pm.environment.set('created_pr_id', body.data.id);
    pm.environment.set('created_pr_number', body.data.prNumber);
});

// ✅ Error case test
pm.test("Status code là 400 khi không có line items", () => {
    pm.response.to.have.status(400);
});

pm.test("Error code chính xác", () => {
    const body = pm.response.json();
    pm.expect(body.success).to.be.false;
    pm.expect(body.code).to.equal('PR_020');
    pm.expect(body.message).to.not.be.null;
});
```

### 3.3 Newman CI Run

```bash
# ✅ Chạy trong Jenkins / local
newman run tests/postman/pr-service.postman_collection.json \
    --environment tests/postman/dev.environment.json \
    --reporters cli,junit,htmlextra \
    --reporter-junit-export target/newman-results.xml \
    --reporter-htmlextra-export target/newman-report.html \
    --delay-request 200 \        # 200ms giữa requests
    --timeout 30000 \            # 30s timeout mỗi request
    --bail                       # Dừng khi có test fail
```

