## 4. PERFORMANCE TEST (JMeter)

### 4.1 Test Scenarios

```
Scenario 1: Normal Load
  - 100 concurrent users
  - Ramp up: 30 giây
  - Duration: 5 phút
  - Actions: Login → Xem danh sách PR → Xem chi tiết PR
  - Target: P95 < 500ms, Error rate < 1%

Scenario 2: Approval Load
  - 50 concurrent approvers
  - Ramp up: 20 giây
  - Duration: 3 phút
  - Actions: Xem inbox → Approve task
  - Target: P95 < 800ms, Error rate < 1%

Scenario 3: Peak Load
  - 500 concurrent users
  - Ramp up: 60 giây
  - Duration: 10 phút
  - Mix: 60% Read, 30% Submit PR, 10% Approve
  - Target: P95 < 1000ms, Error rate < 2%

Scenario 4: Endurance (Soak Test)
  - 200 concurrent users
  - Duration: 1 giờ
  - Target: Memory leak < 5%, Error rate < 0.5%
```

### 4.2 JMeter Test Plan Structure

```
eprocure-performance.jmx
├── Test Plan
│   ├── User Defined Variables
│   │   ├── BASE_URL = ${__P(base_url,http://localhost:8080)}
│   │   ├── USERS    = ${__P(users,100)}
│   │   └── DURATION = ${__P(duration,300)}
│   │
│   ├── Thread Group: Normal Load
│   │   ├── HTTP Cookie Manager       ← Manage session cookie
│   │   ├── HTTP Header Manager       ← Common headers
│   │   ├── Login (Once per user)
│   │   │   └── POST /auth/login → Extract cookie
│   │   ├── List PRs (70% weight)
│   │   │   └── GET /purchase-requests?page=1&size=20
│   │   ├── View PR Detail (20% weight)
│   │   │   └── GET /purchase-requests/${pr_number}
│   │   └── Create PR (10% weight)
│   │       └── POST /purchase-requests
│   │
│   └── Listeners
│       ├── Aggregate Report          ← P50, P90, P95, P99
│       ├── Response Time Graph
│       └── Backend Listener → InfluxDB/Grafana (nếu có)
```

### 4.3 Performance Thresholds

```
P50 (median):   < 200ms   ← Mục tiêu lý tưởng
P90:            < 400ms   ← Acceptable
P95:            < 500ms   ← SLA cam kết
P99:            < 1000ms  ← Hard limit
Error rate:     < 1%      ← Production SLA
Throughput:     > 100 RPS ← Đủ cho 500 concurrent users

Nếu FAIL → KHÔNG deploy production
```

